            "review_title": "Review at Ha Chicken Rice",
            "review_text": "JunJieQuek\nSingapore, Singapore10 contributions\n0\nGood and cheap food\nDec 2018 • Couples\nA typical vietnamese restuarant. We ordered roasted chicken wing rice and sticky rice with honey chicken. The former is just average but the honey chicken sticky rice is delicious especially when mixed with the sauce. Will definitely come again. \n\nPrice of honey chicken sticky rice is 40000\n\nRoasted chicken wing rice is 45000\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 3, 2018",
