            "review_title": "Review at Ha Chicken Rice",
            "review_text": "Jenny L\nHong Kong, China153 contributions\n0\nGreat food but not the service\nNov 2018 • Family\nWe have ordered a plate of half chicken, three plates of Chicken rice and a chicken salad. \n\nEach plate of chicken rice comes with a soup and a plate of sour and chilli sauce. \n\nThey taste good! Personally I prefer honey chicken. Portion is fine! Yet, don’t expect too much if you order a drumstick. The chicken drumstick is small. \n\nBut the staff basically don’t bother to speak at all and they are very cold. \n\nGood things are that the place is clean and they serve food really fast. \n\nIt’s very cheap. It costs only VND$40000 per chicken rice(around USD$2). Worth a try!\nRead more\nWritten November 9, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
