            "review_title": "Review at Ha Chicken Rice",
            "review_text": "Candy L\nHong Kong, China418 contributions\n0\nNo one speak English!!\nDec 2017 • Couples\nWe had lunch at this restaurant. When we ordered the food, we just pointed out the photo on the wall. We try the chicken rice. The rice is too dry. The chicken is skinny and a bit tough. The sauce is okay. The soup is good. The tea on the table is free and cold. The foods are just so-so.\n\nI think the service is terrible. We want to pay but nobody come. We went out and ask the waitress with red uniform. She misunderstood that we want to take an order and gave us a menu. We took some money and want to gave her. She just pointed inside the restaurant. There's no one speak English!!! We don't know how to pay so we just put some money on the table then leave. Actually, we don't know how much was the chicken rice. I hope the money we left was enough. =.=\"\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 14, 2018",
