            "review_text": "Dyganon\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia1247 contributions\n0\nHa Com Ga\nOct 2017 • Family\nWorst chicken rice restaurant in Vietnam. The chicken is bone-y. Normal chicken rice serve with not real chicken meat. Only chicken bits including tendon and fat.\n\nLunch for 3 is 220,000 not including drinks. Expensive affair for street food.\nDrink is sold by different road side vendor. \n\nWon't back again.\nRead more\nWritten October 11, 2017",
