            "review_title": "Review at Ha Chicken Rice",
            "review_text": "Johann M\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam58 contributions\n0\nBest Cơm Gà in Nha Trang! (Chicken Rice)\nNov 2015 • Solo\nThis is a typical local lunch diner for Vietnamese locals. The food is excellent and the waiting is non existent. Get here in time though or they may run out! Chose between boiled or grilled chicken or sometimes i think they also have duck. There is no menu so just point on what looks good and sit down. The special sauce they put on top feels like a type of mayonnaise but it is actually chicken fat. It tastes just fabulous and i found myself going back to this place over and over again for my lunches. Even the simple broth served after the main dish is special. They crack a small Quayle egg in the bowl just before serving and it makes the soup just a little bit creamy and its the perfect finish.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 30, 2016",
